+        // What the ENGINE thinks the input is, as opposed to what the harness believes it scheduled.
+        // Publishing both sides is what makes an input failure diagnosable instead of a guessing game:
+        // `held` is the agent's own view, `key_*` is the value the movement code actually reads through
