+        //
+        // ⚠ EVERY SECTION IS BUILT INTO ITS OWN BUFFER AND APPENDED ONLY ON SUCCESS. The old shape
+        // wrote directly into the shared document and its catch did not roll back, so a read that
+        // threw halfway left a key and its comma behind and the whole state.json became invalid JSON
